          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 2443,
            "text": "{\"content\":\"\\r\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\">\\r\\n   \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<div class=\\\"topBlock\\\">\\r\\n<article>\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n</article>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n<div class=\\\"mainBlock\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<content><content>\\r\\n<kentico-components-expanding-content data-kentico-content=\\\"true\\\">\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n<div class=\\\"page-text\\\"><main>\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h1>Bet on Soccer With Betway</h1>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Kick off your betting journey with the world&rsquo;s favourite sport. From the global stage of the UEFA Champions League to the homegrown excitement of the <a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/psl-betway-premiership-betting-odds\\\">Betway Premiership</a>, every match offers new opportunities to back your team, support your players, and get in on the action across the biggest tournaments and leagues.</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Join Betway today to unlock a world of soccer betting&nbsp;action. Sign up, explore thrilling markets, and bet on the biggest fixtures and tournaments from around the globe.<br>\\r\\n<br>\\r\\nWhen you <a class=\\\"cursor-pointer text-primary-500\\\" onclick=\\\"window.openModal('register')\\\">register</a> an account with us, you&rsquo;ll be able to claim your first deposit bonus, which is credited to your account. Use your first deposit bonus to bet on any sporting event of your choice from football, <a href=\\\"/sport/tennis\\\">tennis</a>, <a href=\\\"/sport/boxing\\\">boxing</a>, <a href=\\\"/sport/formula-1\\\">Formula 1</a> and much more.<br>\\r\\n&nbsp;</p>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>Why Betway Is the Home of Soccer Betting?</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p data-end=\\\"313\\\" data-start=\\\"90\\\">Betway&rsquo;s easy to use website has simplified the sports betting experience. In just a few clicks, you can access non stop sporting action across top markets, including soccer betting with some of the best odds in the game.</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p data-end=\\\"643\\\" data-start=\\\"320\\\">Betway offers competitive odds that create real opportunities to win big, while a secure platform and responsible betting tools ensure you can play safely and with confidence. You also gain access to ongoing <a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/promotions\\\">promotions</a>, where players can win free bets, cash prizes, and even trips to watch their favourite soccer team play.</p>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>How do I bet on soccer?</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Placing your first bet on football is easy. Learn how to bet and get the most up-to-date soccer&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/betting-rules-and-tips\\\">betting tips</a> and make sure you stay ahead of the game.</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Follow these simple steps and learn how to place your first sports bet with us:</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n\\t<li>You can place bets on your PC, mobile device or your tablet</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Navigate to our <a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/\\\">Sports betting page</a>&nbsp;to check on the latest upcoming fixtures</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Select the event you wish to bet on and add it to your betslip</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Enter the amount you wish to stake (the potential returns will be displayed underneath)</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Once you are happy with the selection, click &lsquo;Place Bet&rsquo; to successfully place a bet</li>\\r\\n</ol>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>How can I deposit into my account?</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Get straight into the action and place a bet on any football match of your choice. To be part of thrill of <a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/\\\">sports betting</a>, simply visit our <a class=\\\"cursor-pointer text-primary-500\\\" href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/how-to-deposit\\\" onclick=\\\"window.openModal('deposit')\\\">banking page</a> and make a deposit using any of our safe and secure deposit methods.</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>You can also withdraw your winnings using the same deposit method. To learn more about deposits and withdrawals, visit our <a class=\\\"cursor-pointer text-primary-500\\\" onclick=\\\"window.openModal('deposit')\\\">banking page</a> and let&rsquo;s blow the whistle for kick-off.</p>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>Popular soccer leagues to bet on</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Check out our <a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/\\\">sports page</a> to view a full list of all the events and tournaments we have which include popular football leagues such as:</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n\\t<li>Premier Soccer League</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>English Premier League</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Serie A</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>La Liga</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Primeira Liga</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>UEFA Champions League</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>Betway Premiership</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The <a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/psl-betway-premiership-betting-odds\\\">Betway Premiership</a> is the top-tier football league in South Africa and a favourite among local fans and bettors. Featuring some of the country&rsquo;s most competitive teams, it offers exciting opportunities to wager on matches throughout the season. Popular betting markets include:</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n\\t<li>March Result (1x2)</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Both Teams To Score</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Double Chance</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Both Teams To Score</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>First Goal Scorer</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>English Premier League</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>The <a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/sport/soccer/highlights?selectedLeagues=england_premier-league\\\">English Premier League</a> is one of the most watched league in the world making this a popular choice to bet on. We offer various betting markets on the EPL such as:</p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ul>\\r\\n\\t<li>Match Result (1X2)</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Overs/Unders</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Correct Score</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Anytime Goalscorer</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Double Chance</li>\\r\\n</ul>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>UEFA Champions League</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>In its current format, 32 teams compete in the <a href=\\\"https://www.betway.co.za/sport/soccer/highlights?selectedLeagues=international-clubs_uefa-champions-league\\\">UEFA Champions League</a> each year. The teams are draw into eight groups four. Each team plays every other team in their group twice. A team will receive three points for a win, 1 for a draw and 0 for a loss. The top two teams in each group will then proceed to the knockout stage beginning with a round of 16.</p>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>Place your bets live</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>Has the game started and you forgot to back your favourite team or player? With our <a href=\\\"/live\\\">Live Betting</a> feature, you can place real-time bets while the game is on. All your favourite betting markets, and more, are available when you bet as the action unfolds.</p>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n\\r\\n<section>\\r\\n<h2>Contact us</h2>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p>If you need any assistance, please contact our <a href=\\\"/contact-us\\\">support team</a> available 24/7.</p>\\r\\n</section>\\r\\n</main>\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n</kentico-components-expanding-content>\\r\\n</content></content>\\r\\n</div>\\r\\n  \\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n\"}"
          },
