            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "size": 777,
            "text": "{\"cta\":\"{\\\"loggedIn\\\":{\\\"Action\\\":\\\"NavigateTo\\\",\\\"Value\\\":\\\"/Rugbys-Greatest-Rivalry\\\"},\\\"loggedOut\\\":{\\\"Action\\\":\\\"NavigateTo\\\",\\\"Value\\\":\\\"/Rugbys-Greatest-Rivalry\\\"}}\",\"desktopimage\":\"<img id=\\\"p_lt_ctl00_DesktopImageWebPart_ucEditableImage_imgImage\\\" title=\\\"Desktop Image\\\" src=\\\"https://media.betwayafrica.com/medialibraries/banners.betwayafrica.com/HTML5Banners/South%20Africa/Desktop/36026_SA_Rugby-s_Greatest_Rivalry_Correct_Predictor_600x388_Desktop.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Desktop Image\\\">\",\"mobileimage\":\"<img id=\\\"p_lt_ctl00_MobileImageWebPart_ucEditableImage_imgImage\\\" title=\\\"Mobile Image \\\" src=\\\"https://media.betwayafrica.com/medialibraries/banners.betwayafrica.com/HTML5Banners/South%20Africa/Mobile/36026_SA_Rugby-s_Greatest_Rivalry_Correct_Predictor_850x156_Mobile_1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Mobile Image \\\">\",\"moreinfo\":\"<p><strong>Can you call the score correctly?</strong><br>\\r\\n <br>\\r\\nSuperfans need to <strong>follow these steps:</strong></p>\\r\\n\\r\\n<ol>\\r\\n\\t<li><strong>Place a R50+ bet</strong> on any of these Springboks v All Blacks test matches:\\r\\n\\r\\n\\t<ul style=\\\"list-style-type:circle;\\\">\\r\\n\\t\\t<li>22 August</li>\\r\\n\\t\\t<li>29 August</li>\\r\\n\\t\\t<li>5 September</li>\\r\\n\\t\\t<li>12 September</li>\\r\\n\\t</ul>\\r\\n\\t</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>Get an entry into our Rugby’s Greatest Bet predictor, and choose what you think the score will be</li>\\r\\n\\t<li>If you’re correct, you could win R1 million cash</li>\\r\\n</ol>\\r\\n\\r\\n<p> <br>\\r\\n<strong>Terms and conditions apply.</strong><br>\\r\\n<em>If there is more than one winner, the prize amount will be shared.<br>\\r\\nThe prize amount will not roll over if there is no winner.<br>\\r\\nOne entry per customer per match only.<br>\\r\\nPre-match single and Multi Bets qualify.</em></p>\"}"
